    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active blng__GLRule__c records with no blng__GLTreatment__c child records.
Why it matters: A GL rule with no treatments routes nothing to GL — Billing entries that match this rule fall to defaults, breaking the intended posting strategy. Finance sees mis-categorized revenue at month-end.
Suppress a finding: when a rule is intentionally a placeholder mid-build.
Disable the detector: only if your org uses Billing without GL routing. Most billing orgs should leave this on.</value></values>
